      "snippetId": "bc8e9e0be160f0f8",
      "title": "Ops Console Design Handoff Packet — 5.12 `/attendance` — Attendance & Shifts",
      "text": "- **Spec ref:** §8.4.8, §8.5.7 - **Refresh tier:** T3 (15s) - **Primary persona / roles:** `ops_manager`, `ops_dispatcher` (when supply seems off) - **Primary task:** Verify supply: who is on shift, who is anomalous, what's coming up. - **Must-show data:** - Shift list: shift id, driver, vehicle, scheduled start / end, actual start / end, status, anomaly flag - Attendance records linked to shifts - KPIs: active shifts, completed today, anomalies - **Must-support actions:** - Filter by date, by driver, by anomaly (low) - Drill into driver detail (low — navigation) - **State variants:** - No shifts today: `no_data` (off-day) vs `not_provisioned` (schedule not loaded) - Anomaly spike (multiple no-shows) — visual urgency - **Entry:** Sidebar, dispatch's \"為什麼派不出去\" supply concern - **Exit:** `/drivers/[driverId]` ---",
      "normalizedText": "ops console design handoff packet — 5.12 `/attendance` — attendance & shifts - **spec ref:** §8.4.8, §8.5.7 - **refresh tier:** t3 (15s) - **primary persona / roles:** `ops_manager`, `ops_dispatcher` (when supply seems off) - **primary task:** verify supply: who is on shift, who is anomalous, what's coming up. - **must-show data:** - shift list: shift id, driver, vehicle, scheduled start / end, actual start / end, status, anomaly flag - attendance records linked to shifts - kpis: active shifts, completed today, anomalies - **must-support actions:** - filter by date, by driver, by anomaly (low) - drill into driver detail (low — navigation) - **state variants:** - no shifts today: `no_data` (off-day) vs `not_provisioned` (schedule not loaded) - anomaly spike (multiple no-shows) — visual urgency - **entry:** sidebar, dispatch's \"為什麼派不出去\" supply concern - **exit:** `/drivers/[driverid]` ---",
