      "text": "**裁決: Backend read model 必須提供 `availableActions`，複雜資源可另接 action endpoint。** Preferred: ```ts interface ResourceActionDescriptor { action: string; enabled: boolean; disabledReasonCode?: string; requiresReason?: boolean; riskLevel: \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"; } ``` Pattern: ```http GET /api/{realm}/{resource}/{id} → data.availableActions[] ``` For batch or cross-resource checks: ```http GET /api/actions?resourceType=...&resourceId=... ``` UI 不得只靠 role hard-code 顯示 CTA。 ---",
