      "title": "Operational Glossary And Copy Audit — Purpose",
      "text": "This runbook defines the minimum shared terminology and multilingual copy rules for Phase 1 operational surfaces. It exists to stop the same workflow concept from appearing with different user-facing labels across: - `apps/platform-admin-web` - `apps/ops-console-web` - `apps/driver-app` - `tenant-commute-hub/src` - operator-facing runbooks and UAT notes Canonical product enums and domain semantics still come from: - `phase1_llm_dev_pack_extracted/phase1_llm_dev_pack/00_source_of_truth_and_glossary.md` - `phase1_prd_detailed_v1.md` - `phase1_service_contracts_v1.md` - `docs/02-architecture/phase1-operational-system-design-blueprint-20260429.md` This document governs display copy, not business-state authority.",
      "normalizedText": "operational glossary and copy audit — purpose this runbook defines the minimum shared terminology and multilingual copy rules for phase 1 operational surfaces. it exists to stop the same workflow concept from appearing with different user-facing labels across: - `apps/platform-admin-web` - `apps/ops-console-web` - `apps/driver-app` - `tenant-commute-hub/src` - operator-facing runbooks and uat notes canonical product enums and domain semantics still come from: - `phase1_llm_dev_pack_extracted/phase1_llm_dev_pack/00_source_of_truth_and_glossary.md` - `phase1_prd_detailed_v1.md` - `phase1_service_contracts_v1.md` - `docs/02-architecture/phase1-operational-system-design-blueprint-20260429.md` this document governs display copy, not business-state authority.",
