      "snippetId": "19f0b4eaf4e3dd92",
      "title": "Phase 1 Operator Routing Runbook — Incident handoff",
      "text": "Escalate from exception hold to incident when the order-level dispatch problem now requires formal service recovery, safety review, or command coordination. At handoff time: - preserve the original `orderId` - create the incident with `sourceDispatchExceptionOrderId` - keep recovery actions on the incident record instead of burying them in dispatch-only notes",
      "normalizedText": "phase 1 operator routing runbook — incident handoff escalate from exception hold to incident when the order-level dispatch problem now requires formal service recovery, safety review, or command coordination. at handoff time: - preserve the original `orderid` - create the incident with `sourcedispatchexceptionorderid` - keep recovery actions on the incident record instead of burying them in dispatch-only notes",
