      "text": "This runbook describes the operational procedures for incident escalation, service recovery actions, and the handoff path from dispatch exceptions to formal incidents. Cross-lane ownership routing for incident escalation and adjacent exception / override states is summarized in `docs/03-runbooks/phase1-operator-routing-runbook.md`.",
