      "snippetId": "827f0b98278a2e58",
      "title": "Operational SLA Degradation Runbook — Reporting worker degraded",
      "text": "Indicators: - report queue growth - failed export jobs - dispatch-recording index lag without dispatch write failures Actions: 1. Preserve intake and dispatch compute first. 2. Pause or rate-limit heavy export generation if it competes with core workers. 3. Keep report status visible as queued / failed. 4. Re-run index or export jobs only after core queues stabilize.",
      "normalizedText": "operational sla degradation runbook — reporting worker degraded indicators: - report queue growth - failed export jobs - dispatch-recording index lag without dispatch write failures actions: 1. preserve intake and dispatch compute first. 2. pause or rate-limit heavy export generation if it competes with core workers. 3. keep report status visible as queued / failed. 4. re-run index or export jobs only after core queues stabilize.",
