      "snippetId": "c710e82578879648",
      "title": "Operational SLA Degradation Runbook — Core authority write path degraded or down",
      "text": "Indicators: - order / dispatch / audit writes fail - database or transaction boundary unavailable - operators cannot trust commit acknowledgement Actions: 1. Treat as incident severity `down`. 2. Stop accepting affected synchronous workflows that cannot be durably recorded. 3. Do not represent manual side-channel handling as completed platform work. 4. Recover write-path health before replaying backlog or fan-out jobs.",
      "normalizedText": "operational sla degradation runbook — core authority write path degraded or down indicators: - order / dispatch / audit writes fail - database or transaction boundary unavailable - operators cannot trust commit acknowledgement actions: 1. treat as incident severity `down`. 2. stop accepting affected synchronous workflows that cannot be durably recorded. 3. do not represent manual side-channel handling as completed platform work. 4. recover write-path health before replaying backlog or fan-out jobs.",
